-start=\"395\">Typing Test Admit Card 2025</strong> for Junior Assistant 08/2023.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> Where can candidates check the <strong>Typing Test Admit Card?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Candidates can check the date on the <strong data-end=\"579\" data-start=\"552\">official UPSSSC website</strong> under the <strong data-end=\"630\" data-start=\"590\">\u201cLatest Notifications / Examination\u201d</strong> section.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> Do candidates need login credentials to <strong>view the schedule?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Usually, the schedule is available as a <strong data-end=\"768\" data-start=\"754\">PDF notice</strong> which can be downloaded directly.<br data-end=\"805\" data-start=\"802\"/>\u27a4 For individual schedule verification, <strong data-end=\"889\" data-start=\"848\">Registration Number and Date of Birth</strong> may be required.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What information is mentioned in the <strong>Typing Test notice?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The notice contains <strong data-end=\"1070\" data-start=\"999\">Candidate Name / Roll Number, Test Date, Test Venue, Reporting Time</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"1105\" data-start=\"1076\">Instructions for the exam</strong>.<br/>\n</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website of the <strong>UPSSSC</strong>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website of the <strong>UPSSSC</strong> is <strong>http://upsssc.gov.in/Default.aspx</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"UPSSSC Jr. Assistant 08/2023 Typing Test Admit Card 2025\" class=\"size-large wp-image-26501 aligncenter\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"640\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/0e1a991e-d1a2-4f14-95a0-6a6f5649baae-1-1024x640.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/0e1a991e-d1a2-4f14-95a0-6a6f5649baae-1-1024x640.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/0e1a991e-d1a2-4f14-95a0-6a6f5649baae-1-300x188.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/0e1a991e-d1a2-4f14-95a0-6a6f5649baae-1-768x480.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/0e1a991e-d1a2-4f14-95a0-6a6f5649baae-1.jpg 1280w\" width=\"1024\"/></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-a1cd0fe1\"><span class=\"gb-headline-text\">Sarkari Result.Com.Cm</span></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=in.qmaths.blackbook&amp;referrer=src%3Dsarkariresult.com.cm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Download English Vocab App</a></strong></p>\n<script async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-9762662687323163\" type=\"f17ee362ce73c74a8db65692-text/javascript\"></script>\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-9762662687323163\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7596594071\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display:block\"></ins>\n<script type=\"f17ee362ce73c74a8db65692-text/javascri